  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Revenue Administration and Revenue Policy - The Gambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OTA is providing initial TA to the Gambia Revenue Authority on taxpayer registration, cleaning up the registration database, assigning business codes, and reviewing procedures for processing taxpayer ID registrations. Assistance in internal affairs, internal audit, risk management, and operational management, and strategic planning is slated to begin in 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
